locations.description:
**Location:** [Mazy Cave: Pop Party](#loc=477403) - Pop all 5 balloons hidden in the maze to reveal the gem. They are:
- At the entrance of the maze;
- On the left-hand side of the maze, in a short hall between a grated and solid wall;
- The the hallway behind the Munchoid;
- Right from the last balloon, between the two Munchoids;
- From that room, punch through the wall in the lower right corner. The balloon is at the left-most end of the hallway.
